- `guard(b3, n13, v3 = 'No')`: Violates SMC4/SMC5; the routing condition is logically inverted. The model transitions to `"end process"` when the completion status is `'No'`, contradicting standard workflow semantics where termination should follow successful completion (`'Yes'`).
